---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="角色系统">
  <main class="character-home">
    <p class="eyebrow">AD&amp;D 1e · 角色系统</p>
    <h1>人物与战役</h1>
    <p class="lede">创建角色、管理资源、记录成长，并把长期战役中的事实保存在自己的角色档案里。</p>
    <nav class="character-home-actions" aria-label="角色系统入口">
      <a class="primary" href="/character/create/">创建角色</a>
      <a href="/character/sheet/">我的角色</a>
      <a href="/character/growth/">角色成长</a>
      <a href="/character/journal/">战役记录</a>
    </nav>
    <section class="character-home-grid">
      <article>
        <h2>从规则开始</h2>
        <p>属性生成保留 DMG 四种方法；资格、种族、职业、生命、金钱、语言、熟练、装备与初始法术按创建步骤逐项记录。</p>
        <a href="/character/create/">开始创建 →</a>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>保存自己的档案</h2>
        <p>角色文件可以导入、导出和备份。派生数值由规则模块重新计算，原始骰点和规则来源随档案保留。</p>
        <a href="/character/import/">检查或恢复文件 →</a>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>让战役继续</h2>
        <p>HP、法术、装备、经验、训练、随从和长期活动分开记录；复杂世界裁定留在团桌处理，不塞进普通角色操作。</p>
        <a href="/character/journal/">打开战役记录 →</a>
      </article>
    </section>
    <p class="character-home-note">角色系统使用现有本地档案格式；不会把旧手工表猜成合法角色，也不会在浏览器里伪造战役状态。</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .character-home{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;padding:3rem 1.25rem 5rem}
  .eyebrow{letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8b3530;font-size:.8rem}
  h1{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4rem);margin:.3rem 0 1rem}
  .lede{max-width:42rem;font-size:1.1rem;color:#5f6975}
  .character-home-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.75rem;margin:2rem 0 3rem}
  .character-home-actions a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:2.8rem;padding:.65rem 1rem;border:1px solid #cbd2da;color:#18212b;text-decoration:none}
  .character-home-actions a:hover{background:#f3f5f7}
  .character-home-actions .primary{background:#18212b;color:#fff;border-color:#18212b}
  .character-home-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem;border-top:1px solid #d9dee5;padding-top:1.5rem}
  .character-home-grid article{border-left:3px solid #80652f;padding:0 1rem 1rem}
  .character-home-grid h2{font-size:1.2rem}
  .character-home-grid p{color:#5f6975;font-size:.95rem}
  .character-home-grid a{color:#8b3530}
  .character-home-note{margin-top:2.5rem;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid #d9dee5;color:#5f6975;font-size:.85rem}
  @media(max-width:700px){.character-home{padding-top:2rem}.character-home-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.character-home-actions a{flex:1 1 40%}}
</style>
